# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EuroPad — what does NOT go to git.
#
# Deliberately TRACKED despite looking like artifacts (do not add these):
#   build-and-deploy.ps1     the one supported build/deploy entry point (source, not output)
#   EuroPad-Mobile.apk       install-now snapshot; refreshed by every build-and-deploy.ps1 run
#   EuroPad-Mobile.aab       Play-format snapshot of the same build; needs -Bundle to refresh,
#                            so run ".\build-and-deploy.ps1 -Bundle" before you commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# .NET build artifacts
bin/
obj/
publish/
server-bin/
server-build/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
TestResults/
*.nupkg
*.received.*

# Android / Gradle build outputs
.gradle/
app/build/
app/app/build/
build/
local.properties
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
release/
.kotlin/
*.hprof

# Signing material — a leaked keystore cannot be un-leaked
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
key.properties

# Kotlin / Java
*.class

# IDE & OS
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.DotSettings.user
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Agent & tool states
.kilocode/
.opencode/
.claude/
.kilo/
.kiro/
.gemini/
.tempmediaStorage/
docs/superpowers/

# Working-state docs — private notebooks, deliberately not published. Anything a
# contributor (or future you, on a fresh clone) actually needs lives in README.md.
TASKS.md
TODO.md
MEMORY.md
DECISIONS.md
RULES.md
CONTINUE.md
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
PRD.md
PROJECT_BIBLE.md

# EuroPad runtime logs and machine-local profiles
*.log
logs/
profiles/local-*.json

# Patch / merge leftovers
*.orig
*.rej
